 "description": "Juniper MX104 - a 3.5RU ETSI-depth modular edge router (EOL) for space- and temperature-constrained deployments. Fixed top panel with four 10GbE SFP+ ports, alarm connector, timing block (EXT REF CLOCK and ToD RJ45s, 1PPS and 10 MHz SMB in/out); four MIC slots in two rows (1/0, 1/1 above 0/0, 0/1); two slim Routing Engines stacked at the lower right and two DC power supplies at the lower left. The fan tray is side-mounted; the rear is a plain panel with the earthing plate.",
 "format": 1,
 "gaps": [
  {
   "reason": "sources-disagree",
