   "note": "datasheet-table - physical table: 6.09 in (154.7 mm) high, 17.22 in (437 mm) wide, 9.461 in (240 mm) deep; 9 kg bare / 14.5 kg configured. NOTE the same table scrambles width/depth/height axes on the module rows - the chassis row is self-consistent and carried; ears NOT MODELLED (19.2 in is over the brackets)"
